Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Brings the legacy "Image Sharpening" option back to NVIDIA Control Panel.
; Reboot afterwards. Undo: "Nvidia Legacy Sharpen (undo).reg".
;
; Drivers from the 566 branch onward read their parameters under \Parameters;
; older drivers read the key directly under nvlddmkm. Both are written so the
; file works either side of that change. CurrentControlSet is the live control
; set, so ControlSet001 is not written separately.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services
vlddmkm\Parameters\FTS]
"EnableGR535"=dword:00000000

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services
vlddmkm\FTS]
"EnableGR535"=dword:00000000
